@startuml 3.6.16 - Download Material
title Sequence Diagram — 3.6.16 - Download Material

autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

' === Participants ===
entity "Web dashboard" as webdashboard
boundary "MaterialController" as materialcontroller
control "MaterialService" as materialservice
entity "WorkspaceRepository" as workspacerepository
entity "WorkspaceMemberRepository" as workspacememberrepos
entity "AgencyRepository" as agencyrepository
entity "MaterialRepository" as materialrepository
entity "S3 storage" as s3storage
actor "CREATOR / CLIENT / MANAGER" as creatorclientmanager

' === Flow ===
materialservice -> materialservice: Check session, scope and workspace download permission
creatorclientmanager -> webdashboard: Download selected material
webdashboard -> materialcontroller: GET /api/v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/materials/{materialId}/download
materialcontroller -> materialservice: downloadMaterial(user, command)
materialservice -> workspacerepository: Load workspace
workspacerepository --> materialservice: Workspace
materialservice -> workspacememberrepos: Load membership
workspacememberrepos --> materialservice: WorkspaceMember
materialservice -> agencyrepository: Load agency
agencyrepository --> materialservice: Agency
materialservice -> materialrepository: Load READY, non-deleted material
materialrepository --> materialservice: Material

loop invalid session / forbidden / unavailable resource
  materialservice --> materialcontroller: 401 Unauthorized / 403 Forbidden / 404 Not Found
  materialcontroller --> webdashboard: 401 Unauthorized / 403 Forbidden / 404 Not Found
  webdashboard --> creatorclientmanager: Display access or resource error
end

materialservice -> s3storage: Read exact selected object from S3
s3storage --> materialservice: file stream / storage error

alt storage unavailable
  materialservice --> materialcontroller: 503 Service Unavailable
  materialcontroller --> webdashboard: 503 Service Unavailable
  webdashboard --> creatorclientmanager: Display download error; retry
else file available
  materialservice --> materialcontroller: 200 OK
  materialcontroller --> webdashboard: 200 OK
  webdashboard --> creatorclientmanager: Display download started; browser receives selected file
end

@enduml
